fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#gst_app_sink_get_drop","fragment":"\n\tgst_app_sink_get_drop\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSink.prototype.get_drop\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSink.get_drop\n\nCheck if appsink will drop old buffers when the maximum amount of queued\ndata is reached (meaning max buffers, time or bytes limit, whichever is hit first).\nParameters:\na GstAppSink\nTRUE if appsink is dropping old buffers when the queue is\nfilled.\n\n\tdeprecated\t\t\t: 1.28: Use gst_app_src_get_leaky_type() instead.\n\t\t\nCheck if appsink will drop old buffers when the maximum amount of queued\ndata is reached (meaning max buffers, time or bytes limit, whichever is hit first).\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\ntrue if appsink is dropping old buffers when the queue is\nfilled.\n\n\tdeprecated\t\t\t: 1.28: Use gst_app_src_get_leaky_type() instead.\n\t\t\nCheck if appsink will drop old buffers when the maximum amount of queued\ndata is reached (meaning max buffers, time or bytes limit, whichever is hit first).\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\nTrue if appsink is dropping old buffers when the queue is\nfilled.\n\n\tdeprecated\t\t\t: 1.28: Use gst_app_src_get_leaky_type() instead.\n\t\t\n"});